---
/**
 * Employee conversation — bubbles + composer only (no card chrome).
 * Copy and timestamps match the product screenshot.
 * Reveal order: 1 You → 2 Rolo Rex → 3 composer
 */
---

<div class="w-full max-w-md space-y-3 lg:ml-auto" data-reveal>
  <div
    class="ml-auto max-w-[min(100%,22rem)] rounded-2xl bg-accent px-4 py-3 text-white opacity-0 translate-y-2"
    data-reveal-item
  >
    <p class="text-[0.6875rem] font-medium text-white/75">You · 24 Aug, 13:33</p>
    <p class="mt-1.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed">
      Need to create a new mailbox called qa@openrequest.co and make me and Tommy and Alfie as
      members.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div
    class="mr-auto max-w-[min(100%,22rem)] rounded-2xl bg-zinc-100 px-4 py-3 text-ink opacity-0 translate-y-2 dark:bg-zinc-800"
    data-reveal-item
  >
    <p class="text-[0.6875rem] font-medium text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Rolo Rex · 24 Aug, 13:37</p>
    <p class="mt-1.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">
      Hi Nic - thanks for raising this. We are currently creating the mailbox and will delegate to
      the members as requested.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div
    class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-2.5 opacity-0 translate-y-2 dark:bg-zinc-800"
    data-reveal-item
  >
    <p class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-[0.875rem] text-zinc-400">Write a message...</p>
    <span
      class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent text-white"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none">
        <path
          d="M2.5 7h9M7.5 3.5L11 7l-3.5 3.5"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.5"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
      </svg>
    </span>
  </div>
</div>
